WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:17.382
"Help me with this fort, Squirrel," said Kip.

2
00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:20.541
"Then we'll be safe from snowballs."

3
00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:26.448
Bird laughed. "You two are silly!"

4
00:00:26.449 --> 00:00:29.417
Squirrel and Kip weren't listening.

5
00:00:29.418 --> 00:00:35.887
They got more snow.

6
00:00:35.888 --> 00:00:39.792
They piled it on top of the wall.

7
00:00:39.793 --> 00:00:44.263
Soon the wall was very tall.

8
00:00:44.264 --> 00:00:48.190
"We're safe from snowballs now," said Kip.

9
00:00:48.191 --> 00:00:51.021
The wind blew.

10
00:00:51.022 --> 00:00:58.012
More snow fell on Kip and Squirrel.

11
00:00:58.013 --> 00:01:02.425
"The wall needs to be taller!" cried Squirrel.

12
00:01:02.426 --> 00:01:07.842
Kip and Squirrel got more snow.

13
00:01:07.843 --> 00:01:11.384
But the wind blew again.

14
00:01:11.385 --> 00:01:14.906
"Another snowball hit me!" cried Kip.

15
00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:17.565
"Me too!" cried Squirrel.

16
00:01:17.566 --> 00:01:22.470
Bird sighed.

17
00:01:22.471 --> 00:01:25.367
She flew up to the snowy branches.

18
00:01:25.368 --> 00:01:30.047
Bird shook a branch and . . . Whoomp!

19
00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:33.628
More snow fell on Kip and Squirrel.

20
00:01:33.629 --> 00:01:35.727
Kip and Squirrel looked up.

21
00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:37.484
They saw Bird.

22
00:01:37.485 --> 00:01:42.165
They saw the branches.

23
00:01:42.166 --> 00:01:47.129
And everybody laughed.
